---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy" path="/privacy" description="Privacy for ProjectX by Northlatch Labs LLC.">
<section class="page-hero" style="padding-bottom:24px"><div class="wrap wrap-narrow"><p class="cmd"><span data-glyph="ledger"></span>Privacy policy</p><h1>Privacy</h1></div></section>
<section class="section" style="border-top:0;padding-top:0"><div class="wrap wrap-narrow">
  <div class="less"><ol><li class="h1"># Privacy</li><li>&nbsp;</li><li class="h2">## what we store</li><li class="p">Account email, billing details, service usage counters, and support</li><li class="p">conversations. That is the entire list.</li><li>&nbsp;</li><li class="h2">## the contact form</li><li class="p">The form on /contact posts to this site's own endpoint</li><li class="p">(/api/contact.js). Your name, email, topic, company and message are</li><li class="p">validated here, then sent as one email to hello@projectxprotocol.dev</li><li class="p">through Resend, the transactional-email processor already listed</li><li class="p">below. The message is stored by Resend as email is, and nowhere else;</li><li class="p">this site keeps no form database. The hidden "company website" field</li><li class="p">is a spam trap: it is checked on the server and never sent anywhere.</li><li>&nbsp;</li><li class="h2">## what we do not store</li><li class="p">Wallet private keys, seed phrases, message contents of on-chain</li><li class="p">traffic.</li><li>&nbsp;</li><li class="h2">## third parties</li><li class="p">Payment processing (Stripe), transactional email (Resend — the</li><li class="p">contact form's only hop outside this origin),</li><li class="p">infrastructure (AWS us-east-1; this site's hosting is Vercel).</li><li class="p">None receive more than they need. Updated 2026-11-25: the form no</li><li class="p">longer passes through any form service; it is first-party now.</li><li>&nbsp;</li><li class="h2">## retention</li><li class="p">Kept while your account is active. Deleted within 30 days of account</li><li class="p">closure, except records we must keep for tax.</li><li>&nbsp;</li><li class="h2">## your rights</li><li class="p">Access, export, or delete anytime by emailing</li><li class="p">privacy@projectxprotocol.dev.</li><li>&nbsp;</li></ol><span class="end">(END)</span><div class="mod">// last-modified 2026-11-25</div></div>
</div></section>
</Layout>
